19
00:00:30,933 --> 00:00:32,400
Abróchate el cinturón...

20
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,733
que nos vamos a Leonida.

21
00:00:43,333 --> 00:00:44,867
Para entender lo que va a pasar

22
00:00:44,867 --> 00:00:46,900
