190
00:06:03,633 --> 00:06:05,967
Boobie Ike, una leyenda de Vice

191
00:06:05,967 --> 00:06:06,433
City;

192
00:06:06,433 --> 00:06:08,567
Raul Bautista, un ladrón de bancos

193
00:06:08,567 --> 00:06:09,400
veterano;

194
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:11,433
o Brian Heder, el traficante para

195
00:06:11,433 --> 00:06:13,167
